Original commit body from ae61fd8:

Forgejo/Gitea looks for merge message templates in the .gitea/
directory, not .forgejo/. Added template to both locations for
compatibility.

This is the second part of the commit body preservation fix.
With the template in the correct location, squash merge commits
should now include the full PR description.

Template variables used:
- ${PullRequestTitle} - The PR title becomes the commit subject
- ${PullRequestDescription} - The PR body becomes the commit body
